# WhatsApp 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "whatsapp",
  "description": "WhatsApp 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
    "allowFrom": []
  },
  "features": [
    "QR 码登录",
    "私聊对话",
    "群组消息",
    "媒体文件支持"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 运行: openclaw channels login",
    "2. 打开 WhatsApp → 设置 → 关联设备",
    "3. 扫描屏幕上的 QR 码",
    "4. 等待连接成功",
    "5. 重启 Gateway"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "需要保持登录状态",
    "不支持多设备同时登录",
    "首次登录需要扫描 QR 码"
  ]
}
```

## 高级配置

```json
{
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
    "allowFrom": ["+8613800138000"],
    "groups": {
      "*": {
        "requireMention": true
      }
    },
    "message": {
      "maxMediaSizeMb": 30,
      "typingIndicator": true
    }
  }
}
```

## 常见问题

| 问题 | 解决方案 |
|------|----------|
| QR 码不显示 | 检查 Gateway 是否运行 |
| 登录过期 | 重新运行 login 命令 |
| 收不到消息 | 检查 allowFrom 配置 |

## 文件位置
`templates/channels/whatsapp.json`
